# CAMEL OVERKILL: HUMP-R "RATE DISTRIBUTOR" (second box of the power manager: a circuit box holds at most 64 parts).
name camel_rates
box battery
note "HUMP-R RATE DISTRIBUTOR: HOW IT WORKS" "Turns HUMP-P's charging shares (kW) into battery rates. The game rounds each battery's rate to 10 % (50 kW): every battery gets an equal share in 50 kW steps, q = floor(T / (N x 50)) x 10 %, and ONE battery also takes the remainder. Which one rotates every 30 s (oscillator counter), so the banks stay level and the total is exact."
note "WIRING" "in1 <- HUMP-P out1 (critical share kW), in2 <- HUMP-P out5 (propulsion share kW)\nout1, out5, out6, out7 -> set_rate of propulsion batteries 1..4\nout4, out8 -> set_rate of critical batteries 1, 2"
c zero mem Value=0
c k100 mem Value=100
# equal split in 50 kW steps: the game rounds each battery's rate to 10 % (50 kW here). Every battery gets
# q = floor(T / (N x 50)) x 10 %, and ONE battery also takes the remainder r. Which one rotates every 30 s, so over
# time all of them charge the same and the banks stay level, while the total is always exact.
#   propulsion (N=4, T 0..2000): f = floor(T/200), q = 10 f %, r = T/5 - 40 f %
#   critical   (N=2, T 0..1000): f = floor(T/100), q = 10 f %, r = T/5 - 20 f %
c osc osc OutputType=Pulse Frequency=0.0333
c rot mem Value=0
c k1 mem Value=1
c inc add
c m4 mod Modulus=4
c m2 mod Modulus=2
w rot.out inc.1 m2.in
w osc.out inc.2
w inc.out m4.in
w m4.out rot.in
c k5 mem Value=5
c k10 mem Value=10
c k20c mem Value=20
c k40 mem Value=40
c k200 mem Value=200
c k3 mem Value=3
# critical bank
c cT div ClampMin=0 ClampMax=10
c cf floor
c cq mul
c c5 div
c c20 mul
c cr sub ClampMin=0
w in1 cT.1 c5.1
w k100.out cT.2
w cT.out cf.in
w cf.out cq.1 c20.1
w k10.out cq.2
w k20c.out c20.2
w k5.out c5.2
w c5.out cr.1
w c20.out cr.2
c ce0 equals
c ce1 equals
c cx0 mul
c cx1 mul
c ca0 add ClampMax=100
c ca1 add ClampMax=100
w m2.out ce0.1 ce1.1
w zero.out ce0.2
w k1.out ce1.2
w ce0.out cx0.1
w ce1.out cx1.1
w cr.out cx0.2 cx1.2
w cq.out ca0.1 ca1.1
w cx0.out ca0.2
w cx1.out ca1.2
w ca0.out out4
w ca1.out out8
# propulsion bank
c pT div
c pf floor
c pq mul
c p5 div
c p40 mul
c pr sub ClampMin=0
w in2 pT.1 p5.1
w k200.out pT.2
w pT.out pf.in
w pf.out pq.1 p40.1
w k10.out pq.2
w k40.out p40.2
w k5.out p5.2
w p5.out pr.1
w p40.out pr.2
c pe0 equals
c pe1 equals
c pe2 equals
c pe3 equals
c px0 mul
c px1 mul
c px2 mul
c px3 mul
c pa0 add ClampMax=100
c pa1 add ClampMax=100
c pa2 add ClampMax=100
c pa3 add ClampMax=100
c k2r mem Value=2
w rot.out pe0.1 pe1.1 pe2.1 pe3.1
w zero.out pe0.2
w k1.out pe1.2
w k2r.out pe2.2
w k3.out pe3.2
w pe0.out px0.1
w pe1.out px1.1
w pe2.out px2.1
w pe3.out px3.1
w pr.out px0.2 px1.2 px2.2 px3.2
w pq.out pa0.1 pa1.1 pa2.1 pa3.1
w px0.out pa0.2
w px1.out pa1.2
w px2.out pa2.2
w px3.out pa3.2
w pa0.out out1
w pa1.out out5
w pa2.out out6
w pa3.out out7
c k0 mem Value=0
w k0.out out3

